<title>NORWAY: NORDIC SKIING-RUSSIA WIN WOMEN'S RELAY WORLD TITLE.</title>
<headline>NORDIC SKIING-RUSSIA WIN WOMEN'S RELAY WORLD TITLE.</headline>
<dateline>TRONDHEIM, Norway 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russia won the women's 4x5-km cross-country relay at the Nordic skiing world championships on Thursday in a provisional time of 56 minutes 40.20 seconds.</p>
<p>Norway were second 16 seconds behind and Finland were third 58.20 seconds behind the winners, according to provisional results.</p>
</text>
